shall remain mysterious.

00:02:58.693 --> 00:03:00.296
(audience laughs)

00:03:00.296 --> 00:03:03.000
I mean, I live next door to you,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.440
like, what's going on in your house?

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.170
- [Melissa] This is Friday night, truly.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.825
- Yep, truly.
- This is Friday night.

00:03:08.825 --> 00:03:09.658
I'm not kidding.

00:03:09.658 --> 00:03:10.670
We've done it for over a year.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.503
We have a group.

00:03:11.503 --> 00:03:15.630
We started as movie, a
movie Zoom, oh my God.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:16.650
It's a lot to look at.

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:17.483
- Yep.

00:03:17.483 --> 00:03:18.734
- This is from, what is it, Emile Zola?

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:19.567
- [Ben] "The Life of Emile Zola."

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:20.720
- [Melissa] "The Life of Emile Zola."

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.553
- [Kelly] Amazing.

00:03:21.553 --> 00:03:23.120
- We've watched every Best Picture winner

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.890
and we started over a year ago.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:25.723
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:25.723 --> 00:03:27.830
