to "Lawrence of Arabia,"

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.500
we had one of our friends, Steve Mallory,

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.380
who's in "God's Favorite Idiot,"

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.590
he showed up, he joined
the group on that one

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.720
'cause it's his favorite movie

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.440
and he showed up in full costume.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.540
- Love.
- And it's a bunch of actors,

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:40.840
and directors and producers.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.080
And literally people were
like, oh we're doing that?

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.980
Okay, and so one by one every-

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:45.813
- [Kelly] It got competitive.

00:03:45.813 --> 00:03:47.398
- And now we show up every Friday on Zoom,

00:03:47.398 --> 00:03:48.231
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:03:48.231 --> 00:03:50.600
- In full costume, there's some drinks.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.820
And then we do a Q&amp;A.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.210
We watch the movie during
the week, we do a Q&amp;A,

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.960
