00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.493
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:04:02.493 --> 00:04:03.326
- Yeah, that's so cool.
- 'Cause we were like-

00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:04.180
- What do we do?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.300
- We hadn't seen anyone and
we're like, we're going crazy.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.290
- [Kelly] Yeah, oh my god, I love that.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.170
