were the box of chocolates.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.113
It was pretty amazing.

00:04:27.113 --> 00:04:27.946
(audience laugh)
- Oh, my gosh.

00:04:27.946 --> 00:04:29.930
- [Melissa] It was like,
I made a box of chocolates

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.941
