00:04:46.641 --> 00:04:48.140
Like I'm like, by the way,
while you're doing that,

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.153
I'm just laying on my
couch going so tired.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:55.180
So wait, you are about to be,
this is literally my kids,

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.290
