mean you have the best song.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.710
"Poor Unfortunate Souls", yeah.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:06.380
- It's so weird because
when I was a nanny,

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:10.360
