'cause I don't get to be

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:28.061
in your world of singing and
sliding down a clam shell.

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:28.894
- [Kelly] I know

00:05:28.894 --> 00:05:31.125
- Truly, the clam shell was the
size of a house, I was like.

00:05:31.125 --> 00:05:31.958
