00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.840
I literally burst out
crying cause I was like,

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.800
I don't get to go to
singing class anymore.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.633
Like that's it?

00:05:54.633 --> 00:05:55.583
- You don't get to go to
singing class, I love you.

00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:59.060
- It'd weird if you kept
going, it would be odd.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:05:59.893
- That would be weird?

00:05:59.893 --> 00:06:01.752
Not your Friday night dress
up in a box of chocolates.

00:06:01.752 --> 00:06:03.111
(audience laughs)

00:06:03.111 --> 00:06:04.800
I was like, that's your line?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.633
- That's mine.

00:06:05.633 --> 00:06:07.200
- [Kelly] We found it,
yeah, I was like, okay.

